---
// Footer: trust links, the "report a wrong price" note, and trademarks.
const { itemCount } = Astro.props;
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav aria-label="Footer">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      <a href="#privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="#terms">Terms</a>
      <a href="#how-we-source-prices">How we source prices</a>
      <a href="#sources">Sources</a>
      <a href="#hours">Hours</a>
      <a href="#comparison">Wendy's vs McDonald's</a>
    </nav>
    <p>
      <strong>Report a problem:</strong> spotted a price or calorie count that looks wrong?
      Check the Sources list first, then note the item name, the figure shown here,
      the figure you saw, where you saw it, and the date. Corrections are only made
      from an official Wendy's page — never from a guess.
    </p>
    <p>
      Prices on this page are a dated snapshot, not live prices. Prices vary by
      restaurant and franchisee and may have changed since 22 Nov 2026. Always confirm
      the price at the restaurant before ordering.
    </p>
    <p>
      Wendy's, Dave's Single, Baconator and Frosty are trademarks of their respective
      owners. This site uses the name “Wendy's” only to describe the brand and its menu.
      This site is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Wendy's or
      The Wendy's Company.
    </p>
    <p>Independent fan site · Data checked 22 November 2026 · {itemCount} verified items.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
